1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
@XiaojuSecretScene{SFX:Play|name=birds_after_rain|baseVolume=0.35|endTime=12}

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,600
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}雨停以后，小橘就在我家住下了。

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,600
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}每天上学前，它都要送我到门口。

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,800
[Girl]{Voice:bright}乖乖看家，晚上给你带小鱼干。

5
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,600
{SFX:Play|name=cat_purr|baseVolume=0.5}

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:27,000
[Girl]{Voice:calm}可是最近，它总望着窗外，像在等谁。

7
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,400
{SFX:Play|name=door_slide|baseVolume=0.55}

8
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:33,400
[Girl]{Voice:curious}小橘？……又跑出去了。

9
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:38,000
[Girl]{Voice:calm}窗户开着一条缝。这家伙，已经是第三次了。

10
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,000
{SFX:Play|name=street_ambience|baseVolume=0.28|endTime=58}

11
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,600
[Girl]{Voice:curious}等等——刚才那是……小橘？

12
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:47,400
[Girl]{Voice:curious}这家伙，到底要去哪儿啊……

13
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:50,200
{SFX:Play|name=footsteps_concrete|baseVolume=0.45}

14
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,600
[Girl]{Voice:curious}慢、慢一点呀……

15
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:01,200
[Girl]{Voice:calm}巷子的尽头，是河堤。

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:58,800
{SFX:Play|name=river_wind|baseVolume=0.25|endTime=130}

17
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:06,000
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}今天也来啦？慢慢吃。

34
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:08,100
{SFX:Play|name=cat_purr|baseVolume=0.5}

18
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:09,800
[Girl]{Voice:curious}小橘……居然直接跑过去了？！

19
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:13,000
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}今天画了新的哦。

20
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,000
[Girl]{Voice:curious}那、那不是我们班的转学生吗……

21
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:17,900
{SFX:Play|name=paper_page|baseVolume=0.5}

22
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:20,900
{SFX:Play|name=cat_meow|baseVolume=0.65}

23
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,600
[Boy]{Voice:curious}咦？今天还带朋友来了？

24
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:31,400
[Girl]{Voice:bright}啊、那个……它是我家的猫！

25
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:35,400
[Boy]{Voice:bright}我知道。它每天这个时候都来。

26
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:40,800
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}喏，你看。

27
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,400
[Girl]{Voice:curious}哇……画的全是小橘。

28
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,200
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}这是……

29
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:55,900
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}上个月，在天台对面看到的。一直想画下来。

30
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,200
{SFX:Play|name=cat_purr|baseVolume=0.45}

31
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:01,200
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}明天……它还会来吧？

32
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,600
[Girl]{Voice:bright}嗯。明天见。

33
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:10,400
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}那天我才知道，小橘心里装着的路，不止一条。
